# Input Component Label

The `Input` component from `@/components/ui/input` has a built-in `label` prop. Always use it — never add a `<span>`, `<label>` or any wrapper above the input.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<span className="text-sm font-semibold">Email</span>
<Input type="email" ... />

// ✅ GOOD
<Input label="Email" type="email" ... />
```

The `label` prop also supports `required` (hides the "Optional" badge) and `helperText` for a hint below the field.
